{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>变量</p>","expand":true,"uid":"610157c8-677f-401c-8c3c-42d5442d5863","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>可声明类型</p>","uid":"91229237-8984-43de-a790-aff1d1019b86","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>可变</p>","uid":"4093e142-290f-46fc-b8c1-fd361cb8e1a6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>不可变</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"be1171c1-bae0-4189-933c-c7f8586ded04"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量命名规范</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"433934d6-364e-4402-9a72-f7e9d12ec1af"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>参考：https://beatai.org/rust-course/practice/naming</p>","uid":"053b1c81-660d-494d-ad28-2d6a0b5f17a1","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>不可命名为关键字</p><p>什么是关键字？打印出来IDE变色</p>","uid":"47d6e4c9-95e3-4608-8817-0bbe1693d110","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量忽略</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"f5272019-d38c-428d-b711-86224733f276"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>rust里面不用变量在构建会有warning 需要</p><p>let _x = 10;</p><p>下划线开头</p>","uid":"2d8f6790-4aa8-48ca-984e-49d9acba046e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量解构</p><p>（理解）</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"ea387f9c-4008-420e-8208-9593d31371b0"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>fn main() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let (a, mut b): (bool,bool) = (true, false);</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// a = true,不可变; b = false，可变</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;println!(\"a = {:?}, b = {:?}\", a, b);</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;b = true;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;assert_eq!(a, b);</p><p>}</p>","uid":"5a3d09a1-51cd-4257-9070-2dcf4ad3559a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>解构式子赋值</p><p>（理解）</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"b405fa3a-f467-409b-a51f-f69b896db4c7"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>struct Struct {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;e: i32</p><p>}</p><p><br></p><p>fn main() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let (a, b, c, d, e);</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(a, b) = (1, 2);</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// _ 代表匹配一个值，但是我们不关心具体的值是什么，因此没有使用一个变量名而是使用了 _</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[c, .., d, _] = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Struct { e, .. } = Struct { e: 5 };</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;assert_eq!([1, 2, 1, 4, 5], [a, b, c, d, e]);</p><p>}</p>","uid":"b69d48a7-a3e1-4df3-bf2f-581b74d3521f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量和常量</p>","uid":"76bd2d08-1b09-4217-9ad2-bf8ad52c0f44","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>和其他一样，常量不可变不能mut</p><p>常量使用const进行声明 并且声明必须直接赋予</p><p><br></p>","uid":"9905dc85-a9ae-4e01-8883-1425706cb7b7","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>const MAX_POINTS: u32 = 100_000;</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"571d319c-f3ea-47bd-a6d5-70f1a5723216"},"children":[]}]}]},"theme":{"template":"classic4","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-459,"translateY":-173.5,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"e":-459,"f":-173.5},"state":{"scale":1,"x":-459,"y":-173.5,"sx":-459,"sy":-173.5}}}